<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Vishnugupta</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">c. 540–550 CE</span> · <a href="/centuries/6th-century">6th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Vishnugupta was the last recognised emperor of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gupta-empire">Gupta dynasty</a>, ruling around 540–550 CE. By his time the empire had been reduced to a remnant kingdom by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/huna-people">Huna</a> invasions, succession disputes and the rise of regional powers. After his reign the dynasty dissolved into regional successor states.</p></div>
